{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01P6ssbyfJ2qxqAUQEHdWJUg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good picture. I'm **Vietnam (Bà Triệu)** — a culture/district civ whose districts can sit on woods/rainforest/marsh and gain bonuses there. The land around my capital is loaded with **jungle and marsh** tiles (7,20 / 7,21 / 8,21 / 8,22-bananas), which is ideal for cheap, bonus-rich districts later.\n\nCurrent state is sensible already: capital **Thăng Long** is building a Scout (good — only 3% explored), researching **Pottery** (43%, → Granary/Writing path), civic **Code of Laws** (only option). The one thing needing action is my idle Warrior.\n\nLet me send the Warrior east to reveal the fogged interior (where settle sites and neighbors will be), and confirm research."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6675,"cache_read_input_tokens":32098,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6675},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8553576-5d8f-42a6-8aaa-2aa0ac46ba40","uuid":"9dd45cbe-c8cb-459b-932e-9a0f8320de59","request_id":"req_011CcaLMrk3SXtSUevXeZSZM"}
